  "html": "<div class=\"pe-root pe-node pe-t-page pe-n-root\" data-pe-id=\"root\"><header class=\"pe-node pe-t-section pe-n-hero\" id=\"top\" data-pe-id=\"hero\"><div class=\"pe-in\"><h1 class=\"pe-node pe-t-heading pe-n-h1\" data-pe-id=\"h1\">Build pages <em>faster</em> &amp; &lt;safer&gt;</h1><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-text pe-n-lead\" data-pe-id=\"lead\"><p>A visual editor for <a href=\"https://dnncommunity.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>DNN</strong></a>.<br>No code.</p></div><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-container pe-n-ctas\" data-pe-id=\"ctas\"><a class=\"pe-node pe-t-button pe-n-cta1 pe-btn pe-btn-primary\" href=\"/start\" data-pe-id=\"cta1\">Get started</a><a class=\"pe-node pe-t-button pe-n-cta2 pe-btn pe-btn-outline\" href=\"https://example.com/a?b=1&amp;c=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-pe-id=\"cta2\">Docs &quot;&amp;&quot; more</a></div></div></header><section class=\"pe-node pe-t-section pe-n-features\" data-pe-id=\"features\"><div class=\"pe-in\"><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-container pe-n-card1\" data-pe-id=\"card1\"><h3 class=\"pe-node pe-t-heading pe-n-c1h\" data-pe-id=\"c1h\">Fast</h3><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-text pe-n-c1t\" data-pe-id=\"c1t\"><ul><li>One</li><li><code>Two</code></li></ul><blockquote><p><u><s>Quoted</s></u></p></blockquote></div></div><a class=\"pe-node pe-t-container pe-n-card2\" href=\"/card-2\" data-pe-id=\"card2\"><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-video pe-n-vid pe-ar-16-9\" data-pe-id=\"vid\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ\" title=\"Demo\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; fullscreen\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"></iframe></div></a><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-container pe-n-card3 pe-hide-m my-card featured\" data-pe-id=\"card3\"><hr class=\"pe-node pe-t-divider pe-n-div1\" data-pe-id=\"div1\"><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-spacer pe-n-sp1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-pe-id=\"sp1\"></div></div></div></section><section class=\"pe-node pe-t-section pe-n-free\" data-pe-id=\"free\"><div class=\"pe-in\"><h2 class=\"pe-node pe-t-heading pe-n-fh\" data-pe-id=\"fh\">Heading</h2><figure class=\"pe-node pe-t-image pe-n-fimg pe-fit-contain\" data-pe-id=\"fimg\"><div class=\"pe-empty pe-empty-image\"></div><figcaption>Empty image</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"pe-node pe-t-section pe-n-members\" data-pe-id=\"members\"><div class=\"pe-in\"><div class=\"pe-node pe-t-text pe-n-mtext\" data-pe-id=\"mtext\"><p>Write something here.</p></div></div></section></div>",
  "css": ".pe-root.pe-n-root{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap}\n.pe-root .pe-n-hero{min-height:480px;padding:96px 24px 96px 24px;background-color:var(--dnn-color-primary);background-image:url(\"/Portals/0/hero%20%281%29.jpg\");background-size:cover;background-position:center;color:#ffffff}.pe-root .pe-n-hero>.pe-in{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:nowrap;max-width:960px;margin-inline:auto}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-hero{min-height:320px;padding:48px 16px 48px 16px}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-h1{font-size:56px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-1.5px;text-align:center}\n@media (max-width:1099.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-h1{font-size:44px}}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-h1{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-0.5px}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-lead{max-width:640px;opacity:0.9;font-size:20px;text-align:center}\n.pe-root .pe-n-ctas{display:flex;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;width:fit-content;padding:0px 0px 0px 0px}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-ctas{flex-direction:column}}\n.pe-root a.pe-n-cta1{width:fit-content;flex:0 0 auto}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root a.pe-n-cta1{flex:unset}}\n.pe-root a.pe-n-cta2{width:fit-content;flex:0 0 auto;border-width:2px;border-style:solid}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root a.pe-n-cta2{flex:unset}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-features{padding:48px 24px 48px 24px}.pe-root .pe-n-features>.pe-in{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));grid-auto-rows:minmax(40px,auto);column-gap:32px;row-gap:32px}\n@media (max-width:1099.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-features>.pe-in{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-features>.pe-in{grid-template-columns:repeat(1,minmax(0,1fr))}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-card1{display:block;position:relative;height:200px;grid-column:span 1;grid-row:span 4;background-color:#fff;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:#e5e7eb;border-radius:16px 16px 16px 16px;box-shadow:0px 8px 24px -4px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)}\n.pe-root .pe-n-c1h{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px}\n.pe-root .pe-n-c1t{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px}\n.pe-root a.pe-n-card2{display:block;position:relative;height:200px;grid-column:span 1;grid-row:span 4;padding:16px 16px 16px 16px}\n.pe-root .pe-n-vid{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px}\n.pe-root .pe-n-card3{display:block;position:relative;height:200px;grid-column:span 1;grid-row:span 4;padding:16px 16px 16px 16px;--accent:#ff6600}\n.pe-root .pe-n-div1{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px;color:#999;border-top:2px dashed currentColor}\n.pe-root .pe-n-sp1{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px}\n.pe-root .pe-n-free{padding:48px 24px 48px 24px}.pe-root .pe-n-free>.pe-in{display:block;position:relative;height:500px}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-free>.pe-in{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:nowrap;position:unset;height:unset}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-fh{position:absolute;left:40px;top:40px;width:400px;height:60px;rotate:-3deg;z-index:2}\n@media (max-width:1099.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-fh{left:20px}}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-fh{position:unset;left:unset;top:unset;width:unset;height:unset}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-fimg{position:absolute;left:300px;top:120px;width:320px;height:240px}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-n-fimg{position:unset;left:unset;top:unset;width:unset;height:unset}}\n.pe-root .pe-n-members{padding:48px 24px 48px 24px}.pe-root .pe-n-members>.pe-in{display:block;position:relative;height:400px}\n.pe-root .pe-n-mtext{position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:240px;height:120px}\n@media (min-width:1100px){.pe-root .pe-hide-d{display:none!important}}\n@media (min-width:600px) and (max-width:1099.98px){.pe-root .pe-hide-t{display:none!important}}\n@media (max-width:599.98px){.pe-root .pe-hide-m{display:none!important}}"
